              449.0,
              5024.0
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "It is only half-time, of course, and Arsenal — being Arsenal — will believe they can pull off the turnaround at St James' Park in the second leg next month.",
          "block_bbox": [
            453,
            5026,
            2707,
            5434
