              5434.0
            ],
            [
              453.0,
              5434.0
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "But on the evidence of this showing, they haven't got a cat in hell's chance. Not if they let Isak run riot like he did here.",
