              454.0,
              6355.0
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "Arsenal will know they will need to find an extra gear — maybe two — in the second leg. This was not a display in keeping with the reputation Mikel Arteta has built here.",
