              6762.0
            ],
            [
              456.0,
              6762.0
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "If they can find those levels, then they can head north with hope in their hearts. This was a bruising night for them, but not fatal; they will cling on to that optimism.",
