              454.0,
              8603.0
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "Arsenal’s start to the game was rip-roaring. Declan Rice’s inswinging corners were causing Newcastle all manner of trouble and Timber should really have dispatched a header in the 13th minute from his team-mate’s whipped set-piece.",
