              2248.0,
              10782.0
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "Newcastle's opener was route-one football at its most effective. Dubravka's drilled punt forward was flicked on by Sven Botman, Jacob Murphy bundled it on and the ball was hammered home by Isak.",
