            [
              2252.0,
              11501.0
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "Arsenal’s interest in the Swede is no secret. If the Gunners can make the finances work there is every chance Isak will be wheeling away in celebration at the Emirates more frequently next season. But that’s for then. The present is far more pressing.",
