              5847.0,
              10989.0
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "As it happens, nor did the second-half approach. Again Isak took centre stage when somehow, with three Arsenal players around him, he forced David Raya into a save to leave Gordon the simple task of firing in at the back post.",
          "block_bbox": [
            5845,
